<title>USA: U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</title>
<headline>U.S. wheat, corn and barley export inspections.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Agriculture Department said the 33.556 million bushels of wheat, 26.364 million of corn and 970,000 of barley inspected for export in the week ended Sept 26 were for the following shipment from port areas or inland inspection points (1,000 bu).</p>
<p>	     Wheat     Corn	Barley</p>
<p> Lakes     5,639	Nil	  970</p>
<p> Atlantic    Nil	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Gulf     11,580   26,067	  Nil</p>
<p> Pacific  16,244	Nil	  Nil</p>
<p> Interior     93	297	  Nil</p>
</text>
